      "explanation": "Pair the factors that make simple products: \\(8\\times0.125=1\\) and \\(2\\times0.25=0.5\\). Changing the order and grouping of factors does not change their product, so\n\\[\n8\\times0.25\\times2\\times0.125\n=(8\\times0.125)(2\\times0.25)\n=1\\times0.5=\\frac12.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
